{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/event"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Protocol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Events.swift#L27","fileName":"Events.swift"},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}],"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"externalID":"s:11WorldModule5EventP","title":"Event","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"protocol"},"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"type":"inheritsFrom","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Inherits From"},{"type":"conformingTypes","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/RemovedComponent"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforming Types"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that describes a message one part of a program sends and other parts read later."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Sending-Events","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Events","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EventsView"],"title":"Sending Events"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Event"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sendable","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use events to decouple the code that notices something from the code that responds to it:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a physics step sends a collision, and separate damage and sound systems each read it. Declare","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an event as a type that conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", send it with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/send(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", and read it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/readEvents(_:by:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct Collision: Event { var first: Entity, second: Entity }","enum DamageReader {}","","var world = World()","let ship = world.spawn(Health(current: 3))","let asteroid = world.spawn(Health(current: 1))","world.send(Collision(first: ship, second: asteroid))","","for collision in world.readEvents(Collision.self, by: DamageReader.self) {","    world[Health.self, of: collision.first].current -= 1","}","print(world[Health.self, of: ship])","\/\/ Prints \"Health(current: 2)\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Events wait in the world’s ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Events"},{"text":" resource until ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/updateEvents()"},{"text":" drops them,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so senders and readers don’t need to run at the same moment. Unlike an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityEvent"},{"text":", an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event isn’t aimed at an entity and runs no code when sent.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Event":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A type that describes a message one part of a program sends and other parts read later.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"Event","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Event","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/event","type":"topic"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/send(_:)":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/send(_:)","title":"send(_:)","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/send(_:)","abstract":[{"text":"Sends an event for readers of its type.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"send"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/EventsView":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/eventsview","abstract":[{"text":"A collection of events of one type, oldest first.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EventsView","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EventsView"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EventsView"}],"title":"EventsView"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/EntityEvent":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityEvent","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EntityEvent","kind":"identifier"}],